{"chars": "At the top, five narrow pink-purple petals stretched upward and outward, like the points of a little crown, or ribbons streaming in the wind. Beneath them hung the most wonderful part: a little pouch shaped exactly like a tiny slipper, the kind a fairy might wear to a ball. The front of the slipper was creamy white, sprinkled with pink-purple spots, and right in the middle sat a fuzzy tuft of bright yellow hairs, soft as a baby chick. Inside the slipper ran stripes of reddish brown, like the lines on a seashell. And when Mrs. Claus bent close, she smelled something sweet and warm, like vanilla.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.388, 0.388, 0.388, 0.388, 0.487, 0.487, 0.487, 0.487, 0.825, 0.912, 0.912, 0.912, 0.912, 0.912, 1.25, 1.25, 1.25, 1.25, 1.25, 1.25, 1.25, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 1.6, 2.175, 2.175, 2.175, 2.175, 2.175, 2.175, 2.175, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 2.962, 2.962, 2.962, 2.962, 2.962, 2.962, 2.962, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.35, 3.487, 3.487, 3.487, 3.487, 3.487, 3.487, 3.487, 3.487, 4.225, 4.325, 4.325, 4.325, 4.325, 4.325, 4.487, 4.487, 4.487, 4.487, 4.575, 4.575, 4.575, 4.575, 4.575, 4.575, 4.575, 4.862, 4.862, 4.862, 4.938, 4.938, 4.987, 4.987, 4.987, 4.987, 4.987, 4.987, 4.987, 5.287, 5.287, 5.287, 5.287, 5.287, 5.287, 5.875, 5.975, 5.975, 5.975, 6.125, 6.125, 6.125, 6.125, 6.125, 6.125, 6.125, 6.125, 6.537, 6.537, 6.537, 6.537, 6.537, 6.537, 6.537, 6.537, 6.537, 6.537, 6.963, 6.963, 6.963, 7.037, 7.037, 7.037, 7.037, 7.125, 7.125, 7.125, 7.125, 7.125, 7.925, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.05, 8.425, 8.425, 8.425, 8.425, 8.425, 8.65, 8.65, 8.65, 8.65, 8.65, 8.838, 8.838, 8.838, 8.838, 8.925, 8.925, 8.925, 8.925, 8.925, 9.2, 9.2, 9.2, 9.2, 9.2, 9.2, 9.2, 9.2, 9.2, 9.2, 9.675, 9.675, 9.675, 9.675, 9.675, 10.325, 10.425, 10.425, 10.488, 10.488, 10.488, 10.488, 10.488, 10.488, 10.488, 10.75, 10.75, 10.75, 10.75, 10.75, 10.75, 11.088, 11.088, 11.088, 11.088, 11.088, 11